    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Viewer-heures",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "zevent-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "zevent-pg"
          },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT coalesce(sum(x.viewers * least(x.gap_s, 300)), 0) / 3600.0 FROM streamer_sample_v x JOIN streamer_v st USING (twitch_id) WHERE $__timeFilter(x.ts) AND NOT st.derived AND x.twitch_id IN ($streamer) AND coalesce(st.location, '') ~ '^(${location:regex})$' AND x.gap_s IS NOT NULL",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "purple"
          },
          "unit": "sishort",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "description": "La taille de l'audience dans le temps, en viewer-heures : le nombre de viewers des streamers correspondant aux filtres Lieu et Streamer, additionn\u00e9 minute par minute sur la p\u00e9riode s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e (chaque relev\u00e9 compte le temps \u00e9coul\u00e9 depuis le pr\u00e9c\u00e9dent, plafonn\u00e9 \u00e0 5 minutes pour que les trous dans les donn\u00e9es ne comptent pas). Un viewer qui regarde pendant une heure vaut une viewer-heure ; 1 000 viewers pendant 2 heures font 2 000 viewer-heures."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Heures de stream",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "zevent-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "zevent-pg"
          },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT coalesce(sum(least(s.gap_s, 300)) FILTER (WHERE s.online), 0) / 3600.0 FROM streamer_sample_v s JOIN streamer_v st USING (twitch_id) WHERE NOT st.derived AND coalesce(st.location, '') ~ '^(${location:regex})$' AND $__timeFilter(s.ts) AND s.twitch_id IN ($streamer) AND s.gap_s IS NOT NULL",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          },
          "unit": "suffix: h",
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "description": "Temps total en live, additionn\u00e9 sur les streamers correspondant aux filtres Lieu et Streamer, dans la plage de temps s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e. Chaque relev\u00e9 en live compte la minute \u00e9coul\u00e9e depuis le relev\u00e9 pr\u00e9c\u00e9dent (plafonn\u00e9e \u00e0 5 minutes, pour que les trous dans les donn\u00e9es ne comptent pas)."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dons par viewer-heure",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "zevent-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "zevent-pg"
          },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "WITH g AS (  SELECT s.twitch_id, sum(s.gain) AS gained FROM streamer_sample_v s  WHERE $__timeFilter(s.ts) AND s.gain IS NOT NULL GROUP BY s.twitch_id) , v AS (  SELECT sum(x.viewers * least(x.gap_s, 300)) / 3600.0 AS viewer_hours  FROM streamer_sample_v x JOIN streamer_v st USING (twitch_id)  WHERE $__timeFilter(x.ts) AND NOT st.derived AND x.twitch_id IN ($streamer) AND coalesce(st.location, '') ~ '^(${location:regex})$' AND x.gap_s IS NOT NULL) SELECT (SELECT coalesce(sum(g.gained), 0) FROM g JOIN streamer_v st USING (twitch_id)         WHERE NOT st.derived AND g.twitch_id IN ($streamer) AND coalesce(st.location, '') ~ '^(${location:regex})$') / nullif(v.viewer_hours, 0) FROM v",
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          },
          "unit": "currencyEUR",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "description": "Ce que la communaut\u00e9 donne par rapport \u00e0 sa taille : les dons gagn\u00e9s par les streamers correspondant aux filtres Lieu et Streamer sur la p\u00e9riode s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e, divis\u00e9s par leurs viewer-heures (le nombre de viewers additionn\u00e9 minute par minute sur la m\u00eame p\u00e9riode, en heures). Un viewer qui regarde pendant une heure vaut une viewer-heure : 5 \u20ac signifie 5 \u20ac r\u00e9colt\u00e9s pour chaque heure regard\u00e9e par un viewer. Les dons sans streamer (billets, boutique, anonymes) ne sont pas compt\u00e9s."
    },
